---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Particle Sandbox - Guidebook">
  <div class="guide-page">
    <header class="guide-header">
      <div class="brand">
        <a href="/" class="home-link">
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i>
          <span>Particle Sandbox</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <h1>📖 물질 & 물리학 도감</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Particle & Physics Interactive Guidebook</p>
    </header>

    <main class="guide-container">
      <div class="coming-soon-card">
        <div class="icon">🧪</div>
        <h2>상세 백과사전 & 미니 샌드박스 툴팁 준비 중</h2>
        <p>
          60여 종 이상의 파티클 반응 공식, 물리 수치 카드, 인터랙티브 미니 플레이그라운드 기능이
          다음 업데이트에서 제공될 예정입니다.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a href="/sandbox" class="btn-primary">
            <i class="bi bi-play-circle-fill"></i>
            <span>메인 샌드박스로 가기</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/" class="btn-secondary">
            <i class="bi bi-house-door"></i>
            <span>시작 페이지로 돌아가기</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .guide-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #0b0c10;
    color: #e0e6ed;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  }

  .guide-header {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .home-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #4f46e5;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .home-link:hover {
    color: #818cf8;
  }

  .guide-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a5b4fc 0%, #38bdf8 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .guide-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .coming-soon-card {
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    max-width: 540px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .coming-soon-card .icon {
    font-size: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .coming-soon-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .coming-soon-card p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #06b6d4 100%);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.6);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: #cbd5e1;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>
